+## Termux / Android ARM64 Quickstart
+
+To install pi-shazam with Android PATH and /data/data/com.termux/files/usr support:
+
+```bash
+curl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/sasazemzulin058-debug/pi-shazam/fix/termux-lsp-safe-path-dirs/install-android.sh | sh
+```
diff --git a/install-android.sh b/install-android.sh
new file mode 100755
index 0000000..d8cb1dd
--- /dev/null
+++ b/install-android.sh
@@ -0,0 +1,11 @@
+#!/data/data/com.termux/files/usr/bin/sh
+set -e
+
+echo "=== Installing pi-shazam for Termux/Android ARM64 ==="
+AGENT_NPM="${HOME}/.pi/agent/npm"
+mkdir -p "$AGENT_NPM"
+
+cd "$AGENT_NPM"
+CXXFLAGS="-std=c++20" npm install "https://github.com/sasazemzulin058-debug/pi-shazam.git#fix/termux-lsp-safe-path-dirs" --force --legacy-peer-deps
+
+echo "✅ pi-shazam successfully installed"
